    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Abbey Lane, Carrigaline is an exclusive development of 10 only four bedroomed detached homes all located within a quite cul de sac off the Mountain Road in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nMichael Pigott proudly introduces these architectural designed A2 rated four bedroom detached homes with an exceptional large floor area of 193 sq metres (2,080sqft). It comprises a hugely impressive open plan kitchen/dining/living area with extensive glazing to avail of its perfect south facing orientation to the rear, guest WC & separate living room on the ground floor and the upper floors comprise of four spacious double bedrooms (2 en-suites, 1 walk-in wardrobe) & main bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the garden offers a huge amount of privacy not being overlooked and to the front, has a lovely cobble-lock driveway as well as having the benefit of enjoying a cul de sac position and overlooking a nice green area.\r\n\r\nAbbey Lane is perfectly positioned just minutes to all amenities and services in Carrigaline and also is just a short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport and Ringaskiddy. It has easy access to a regular 24 hour public bus service and also benefits hugely from the newly opened Western Relief road.\r\n\r\nCarrigaline has a village type feel with many amenities close to hand to include four banks a credit union, a Supervalu supermarket, Dunnes Stores Aldi & Lidl.\r\n\r\nThis popular well-established location is ideal for families of all sizes and stages of life. With the benefit of excellent transport links, Cork City Centre and City Airport Business Park 15 minutes' drive away with local recreation, leisure facilities and schools on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
