        "Content": "Size; 193 sq mteres (2,075sq ft)\r\nAir to Water Heat Pump\r\nUnderfloor heating on ground floor\r\nPrivate enclosed south facing garden\r\nLarge open plan kitchen/dining/living room\r\n2 en-suite bedrooms\r\nSmall exclusive development of just 10 houses\r\nOverlooking a nice green area"
      },
